                        PRC 052, 2/17/78, Southern Africa—Rhodesia.
                    Confidential.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d77-f2" n="2" xml:id="d77-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d76">Document 76</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d77-f3" n="3" xml:id="d77-f3-content">
                <p>In telegram 5768 from USUN, December 22, 1977,
                    the Mission reported on a December 21 meeting in which the Contact Group agreed
                    to hold a round of “Proximity Talks” in New York. The meetings with the South
                    African Government and SWAPO would be held at
                    the same time, but in separate locations. (National Archives, RG 59, Central Foreign Policy File,
                    D770476–1049)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
